(4666785, 672325, 5364, '<td valign="top">It''s a good picture but it feels that (s)he''s on the wrong side of the frame and would be looking into the space if on the left side, rahter than looking into the side of the picture.</td>', 'It''s a good picture but it feels that (s)he''s on the wrong side of the frame and would be looking into the space if on the left side, rahter than looking into the side of the picture.', '2008-04-30 03:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666789, 673231, 5364, '<td valign="top">I think I would have preferred to see some writing on the pages of the book, rather than the over bright light. Nicely done otherwise.</td>', 'I think I would have preferred to see some writing on the pages of the book, rather than the over bright light. Nicely done otherwise.', '2008-04-30 03:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666797, 674466, 5364, '<td valign="top">It''s an OK image, but I feel you could have done with some foreground interest</td>', 'It''s an OK image, but I feel you could have done with some foreground interest', '2008-04-30 04:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666823, 674359, 28742, '<td valign="top">Miley Cyrus? ;-)</td>', 'Miley Cyrus? ;-)', '2008-04-30 04:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666859, 674179, 37252, '<td valign="top">Sepia tone refers to the coloring of a black and white photographic print that has been toned with a sepia toner to simulate the faded brownish color of some early photographs. Your image contains other colors too, thus not really following the challenge theme. Aside from that, the faces are too shadowed, not allowing much detail or emotion to come out.</td>', 'Sepia tone refers to the coloring of a black and white photographic print that has been toned with a sepia toner to simulate the faded brownish color of some early photographs. Your image contains other colors too, thus not really following the challenge theme. Aside from that, the faces are too shadowed, not allowing much detail or emotion to come out.', '2008-04-30 04:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666865, 674359, 37252, '<td valign="top">There is a serious lack of focus here. I also find the halo around the model to be distracting</td>', 'There is a serious lack of focus here. I also find the halo around the model to be distracting', '2008-04-30 05:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666867, 673709, 37252, '<td valign="top">Too grainy and OOF. The crop is also undesirable</td>', 'Too grainy and OOF. The crop is also undesirable', '2008-04-30 05:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666869, 672409, 37252, '<td valign="top">Sepia tone refers to the coloring of a black and white photographic print that has been toned with a sepia toner to simulate the faded brownish color of some early photographs. Looks close, but a bit green yet.<br/>Aside from that, your focus is nice and sharp. Nice details. The DOF is prefect for this too.</td>', 'Sepia tone refers to the coloring of a black and white photographic print that has been toned with a sepia toner to simulate the faded brownish color of some early photographs. Looks close, but a bit green yet.Aside from that, your focus is nice and sharp. Nice details. The DOF is prefect for this too.', '2008-04-30 05:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666879, 674118, 37252, '<td valign="top">Much too orange for sepia. Sepia tone refers to the coloring of a black and white photographic print that has been toned with a sepia toner to simulate the faded brownish color of some early photographs.</td>', 'Much too orange for sepia. Sepia tone refers to the coloring of a black and white photographic print that has been toned with a sepia toner to simulate the faded brownish color of some early photographs.', '2008-04-30 05:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666880, 673450, 37252, '<td valign="top">Sepia tone refers to the coloring of a black and white photographic print that has been toned with a sepia toner to simulate the faded brownish color of some early photographs. Obviously this image is not a sepia, yet you chose to enter it in a Sepia challenge. Perhaps you did not know what sepia meant. <br/>Aside from that, I like the perspective / composition. The expression on the face of the woman shoes a relaxing and enjoyable ride.</td>', 'Sepia tone refers to the coloring of a black and white photographic print that has been toned with a sepia toner to simulate the faded brownish color of some early photographs. Obviously this image is not a sepia, yet you chose to enter it in a Sepia challenge. Perhaps you did not know what sepia meant. Aside from that, I like the perspective / composition. The expression on the face of the woman shoes a relaxing and enjoyable ride.', '2008-04-30 05:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666881, 673935, 37252, '<td valign="top">Too tightly cropped and out of focus</td>', 'Too tightly cropped and out of focus', '2008-04-30 05:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666882, 674035, 37252, '<td valign="top">Sepia tone refers to the coloring of a black and white photographic print that has been toned with a sepia toner to simulate the faded brownish color of some early photographs. While the wall does have brown tones, the image itself is not a sepia at all.</td>', 'Sepia tone refers to the coloring of a black and white photographic print that has been toned with a sepia toner to simulate the faded brownish color of some early photographs. While the wall does have brown tones, the image itself is not a sepia at all.', '2008-04-30 05:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666883, 674394, 37252, '<td valign="top">While this does have some brown tones in it, you also have greens and yellows. Sepia tone refers to the coloring of a black and white photographic print that has been toned with a sepia toner to simulate the faded brownish color of some early photographs.<br/> <br/>Aside from that, the highlights are a bit blown out by the harsh sunlight also.</td>', 'While this does have some brown tones in it, you also have greens and yellows. Sepia tone refers to the coloring of a black and white photographic print that has been toned with a sepia toner to simulate the faded brownish color of some early photographs. Aside from that, the highlights are a bit blown out by the harsh sunlight also.', '2008-04-30 05:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666887, 674228, 37252, '<td valign="top">I really don''t care for the vignetting here. Also would like to see this with a wider scale of brown tones.</td>', 'I really don''t care for the vignetting here. Also would like to see this with a wider scale of brown tones.', '2008-04-30 05:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666890, 674426, 37252, '<td valign="top">The lighting was poorly aimed resulting in some undesirable shadows. As for the composition, it would have been better to follow the rule of thirds here, instead of centering the model. Some fill light would have lit up the face better and showed more expression.</td>', 'The lighting was poorly aimed resulting in some undesirable shadows. As for the composition, it would have been better to follow the rule of thirds here, instead of centering the model. Some fill light would have lit up the face better and showed more expression.', '2008-04-30 05:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666891, 672660, 37252, '<td valign="top">Sepia tone refers to the coloring of a black and white photographic print that has been toned with a sepia toner to simulate the faded brownish color of some early photographs. The blue shows me this really is not a true sepia. I do like the upward perspective and sharp focus.</td>', 'Sepia tone refers to the coloring of a black and white photographic print that has been toned with a sepia toner to simulate the faded brownish color of some early photographs. The blue shows me this really is not a true sepia. I do like the upward perspective and sharp focus.', '2008-04-30 05:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666892, 673131, 49643, '<td valign="top">Nice concept. I Think  Vertical composition may have worked better.</td>', 'Nice concept. I Think  Vertical composition may have worked better.', '2008-04-30 05:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666893, 674394, 27133, '<td valign="top">Not sepia....the water is though.</td>', 'Not sepia....the water is though.', '2008-04-30 05:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666894, 673902, 37252, '<td valign="top">Sepia tone refers to the coloring of a black and white photographic print that has been toned with a sepia toner to simulate the faded brownish color of some early photographs. The greens in this image show this is not really a sepia at all.<br/>Aside from that, I find the angle really hampers rather than helps this image.</td>', 'Sepia tone refers to the coloring of a black and white photographic print that has been toned with a sepia toner to simulate the faded brownish color of some early photographs. The greens in this image show this is not really a sepia at all.Aside from that, I find the angle really hampers rather than helps this image.', '2008-04-30 05:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666895, 673395, 37252, '<td valign="top">More gray tones than browns, at least to me. The graininess is a bit over powering also.</td>', 'More gray tones than browns, at least to me. The graininess is a bit over powering also.', '2008-04-30 05:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
