(4666917, 673276, 37252, '<td valign="top">Sepia tone refers to the coloring of a black and white photographic print that has been toned with a sepia toner to simulate the faded brownish color of some early photographs. The color tones here just seem more b/w ....a lot of grays, rather than browns. <br/>Aside from that the composition is strong, as is the focus</td>', 'Sepia tone refers to the coloring of a black and white photographic print that has been toned with a sepia toner to simulate the faded brownish color of some early photographs. The color tones here just seem more b/w ....a lot of grays, rather than browns. Aside from that the composition is strong, as is the focus', '2008-04-30 05:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666920, 674478, 37252, '<td valign="top">the browns don''t really have the sepia look to me. I just see flat lighting on brown stones. The focus had it been sharper could have really brought out more textures. This just lacks any real interest for me.</td>', 'the browns don''t really have the sepia look to me. I just see flat lighting on brown stones. The focus had it been sharper could have really brought out more textures. This just lacks any real interest for me.', '2008-04-30 05:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666923, 673110, 37252, '<td valign="top">Too bad you could not have shot a close up of Donald Duck. He looks to have some interesting aging textures.</td>', 'Too bad you could not have shot a close up of Donald Duck. He looks to have some interesting aging textures.', '2008-04-30 05:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
