(4667049, 672658, 88204, '<td valign="top">Perfect shot for this challenge! Wonderful background, lighting, clothing. The hair clip jumps out as more modern that everything else. Also, I wish the dress didn''t cut off at the bottom of the frame. Great shot!</td>', 'Perfect shot for this challenge! Wonderful background, lighting, clothing. The hair clip jumps out as more modern that everything else. Also, I wish the dress didn''t cut off at the bottom of the frame. Great shot!', '2008-04-30 08:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
