(4667056, 672732, 53147, '<td valign="top">This is easily my pick for blue. Unfortunately it probably wont get there, and that is just a shame. So hopefully this will help tide you over as I think this shot is brilliant. I so wish I could find stuff like this.<a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=649858" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53147/120/649858.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53147/120/649858.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53147/120/649858.jpg"/></a></td>', 'This is easily my pick for blue. Unfortunately it probably wont get there, and that is just a shame. So hopefully this will help tide you over as I think this shot is brilliant. I so wish I could find stuff like this.', '2008-04-30 08:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
