(4667077, 674258, 51793, '<td valign="top">There is a sharp shadow on her right shoulder and the eyes are a bit dark. Have your model move to a more shaded area and that should give you some really nice lighting.</td>', 'There is a sharp shadow on her right shoulder and the eyes are a bit dark. Have your model move to a more shaded area and that should give you some really nice lighting.', '2008-04-30 08:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
