(4667084, 673355, 51793, '<td valign="top">Kind of borning and the branches in the front are very distracting. Very few times can a blurry branch really add anything to an image. try to watch that next time. Also watch the time of day you shoot because there are some very harsh shadows here. If you can''t avoid the time try moving around the subject to get a different angle. Instead  of shooting from far away you might get closer and then in processing you could zoom in and create a interesting shot that way.</td>', 'Kind of borning and the branches in the front are very distracting. Very few times can a blurry branch really add anything to an image. try to watch that next time. Also watch the time of day you shoot because there are some very harsh shadows here. If you can''t avoid the time try moving around the subject to get a different angle. Instead  of shooting from far away you might get closer and then in processing you could zoom in and create a interesting shot that way.', '2008-04-30 08:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4667085, 673636, 51793, '<td valign="top">The image lacks contrast and seems a bit flat to me.</td>', 'The image lacks contrast and seems a bit flat to me.', '2008-04-30 08:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
