(4667634, 672970, 80458, '<td valign="top">Very nice tones. I hate to be picky on such a great photograph but i''m going to anyways - my only slight criticism is that you seem to have some blown out spots of light near st james cathedral and I dont like the reflection in the water all the way in the bottom left corner. But, great job.</td>', 'Very nice tones. I hate to be picky on such a great photograph but i''m going to anyways - my only slight criticism is that you seem to have some blown out spots of light near st james cathedral and I dont like the reflection in the water all the way in the bottom left corner. But, great job.', '2008-04-30 12:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
