(4668818, 673625, 53416, '<td valign="top">The out of focus dark sploge in the foreground is too distracting.  Nice soft downy feel to the pic though.</td>', 'The out of focus dark sploge in the foreground is too distracting.  Nice soft downy feel to the pic though.', '2008-04-30 18:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4668825, 674305, 53416, '<td valign="top">Great texture and detail!  Good lighting and interesting composition.  Makes me wonder what horrific event has just happened?!  Well done.</td>', 'Great texture and detail!  Good lighting and interesting composition.  Makes me wonder what horrific event has just happened?!  Well done.', '2008-04-30 18:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
