(4668830, 674376, 53416, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and good texture.  I feel the highlights are a little too overblown - even though that''s probably the effect you were going for...</td>', 'Nice composition and good texture.  I feel the highlights are a little too overblown - even though that''s probably the effect you were going for...', '2008-04-30 18:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4668831, 673340, 70896, '<td valign="top">I LOVE the reflection on the building, but there''s a weird quality to the photo that im not sure of. I cant decide if its too contrasted or if the focus is too soft. If I were you I would go back and retake it, because it looks like a really cool location. 8</td>', 'I LOVE the reflection on the building, but there''s a weird quality to the photo that im not sure of. I cant decide if its too contrasted or if the focus is too soft. If I were you I would go back and retake it, because it looks like a really cool location. 8', '2008-04-30 18:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4668833, 672410, 53416, '<td valign="top">Nice composiotn and detail.  The out of focus background is also well done.  Nice.</td>', 'Nice composiotn and detail.  The out of focus background is also well done.  Nice.', '2008-04-30 18:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4668836, 674571, 70896, '<td valign="top">It has a bit of a greenish tint, but I love the photo. 8</td>', 'It has a bit of a greenish tint, but I love the photo. 8', '2008-04-30 18:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
