(4669401, 672815, 37252, '<td valign="top">I get the feeling that the scenery here is better in person. I find those type places myself where I love what I am seeing, but just cannot convey it well enough in photos. Maybe it''s the composition, or the perspective - just nothing here pops or grabs me. I''d try shooting from down low, or up high next time.</td>', 'I get the feeling that the scenery here is better in person. I find those type places myself where I love what I am seeing, but just cannot convey it well enough in photos. Maybe it''s the composition, or the perspective - just nothing here pops or grabs me. I''d try shooting from down low, or up high next time.', '2008-04-30 23:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
