(4671854, 673073, 63269, '<td valign="top">I admit I don''t care for the yellowish color tones, and the harsh contrast. I personally would would suggest working the color into something a little more reddish or coppery. But the lighting and the tones you''ve captured here are just exquisite - beautiful work!</td>', 'I admit I don''t care for the yellowish color tones, and the harsh contrast. I personally would would suggest working the color into something a little more reddish or coppery. But the lighting and the tones you''ve captured here are just exquisite - beautiful work!', '2008-05-01 15:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
