(4671868, 674580, 63269, '<td valign="top">This is just a nit-pick, but I might suggest cropping the rest of the camp chair out of the picture. Sweet capture though.</td>', 'This is just a nit-pick, but I might suggest cropping the rest of the camp chair out of the picture. Sweet capture though.', '2008-05-01 15:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4671877, 674491, 53416, '<td valign="top">Ugh - I despise all gastropods!!!<br/> <br/>Don''t worry though, the photograph is well composed, with good texture (ugh!) and with a good depth of field.  Well done.</td>', 'Ugh - I despise all gastropods!!! Don''t worry though, the photograph is well composed, with good texture (ugh!) and with a good depth of field.  Well done.', '2008-05-01 15:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4671880, 674333, 53416, '<td valign="top">Great texture, composition, lighting, contrast, etc, etc.  Not really brown enough to be sepia for me though...</td>', 'Great texture, composition, lighting, contrast, etc, etc.  Not really brown enough to be sepia for me though...', '2008-05-01 15:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4671886, 674318, 53416, '<td valign="top">Nice street photography effort.</td>', 'Nice street photography effort.', '2008-05-01 15:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4671890, 674276, 53416, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and detail.</td>', 'Nice composition and detail.', '2008-05-01 15:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4671894, 673902, 63269, '<td valign="top">My eye isn''t sure where to rest in the photo - the composition is too cluttered. But it looks like you have a very interesting subject to work with. Perhaps there were too many things around it to move however. Next time, try some different angles and camera positions. The bikes don''t seem to be doing anything for the picture, see if you can either move them or shoot the photo in such a way that you can crop them out. Good luck! :)</td>', 'My eye isn''t sure where to rest in the photo - the composition is too cluttered. But it looks like you have a very interesting subject to work with. Perhaps there were too many things around it to move however. Next time, try some different angles and camera positions. The bikes don''t seem to be doing anything for the picture, see if you can either move them or shoot the photo in such a way that you can crop them out. Good luck! :)', '2008-05-01 15:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4671896, 674496, 53416, '<td valign="top">The sky is brilliant - very moody.</td>', 'The sky is brilliant - very moody.', '2008-05-01 15:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4671902, 674578, 53416, '<td valign="top">Nice reflections, and capture of the sloshing water.</td>', 'Nice reflections, and capture of the sloshing water.', '2008-05-01 15:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4671905, 674569, 53416, '<td valign="top">Good depth of field, but the other limbs are a bit distracting.</td>', 'Good depth of field, but the other limbs are a bit distracting.', '2008-05-01 15:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4671906, 672870, 63269, '<td valign="top">The lighting here is very interesting, the way it only curves around one edge of the subject. I think it works well with the sepia. My only suggestion would be to create a more interesting composition or a more dynamic camera angle. Otherwise, this is good!</td>', 'The lighting here is very interesting, the way it only curves around one edge of the subject. I think it works well with the sepia. My only suggestion would be to create a more interesting composition or a more dynamic camera angle. Otherwise, this is good!', '2008-05-01 15:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4671908, 674335, 53416, '<td valign="top">Nice blurry background.  Really like the fluffy texture too.</td>', 'Nice blurry background.  Really like the fluffy texture too.', '2008-05-01 15:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4671910, 674324, 53416, '<td valign="top">Very good low key photograph.  Great lighting and strong detail.  Wish it was more brown for a ''sepia'' challenge though.</td>', 'Very good low key photograph.  Great lighting and strong detail.  Wish it was more brown for a ''sepia'' challenge though.', '2008-05-01 15:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4671912, 674342, 53416, '<td valign="top">Great texture and detail to study.  I like the composition too - it keeps pulling my eyes all over the place, jumping from one detail to the next.  Nice!</td>', 'Great texture and detail to study.  I like the composition too - it keeps pulling my eyes all over the place, jumping from one detail to the next.  Nice!', '2008-05-01 15:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4671913, 674264, 53416, '<td valign="top">I love the feel of depth to this photograph.  The graininess compliments the picture well.</td>', 'I love the feel of depth to this photograph.  The graininess compliments the picture well.', '2008-05-01 15:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4671914, 674499, 53416, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t have a real focal point and is a bit busy.</td>', 'Doesn''t have a real focal point and is a bit busy.', '2008-05-01 15:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4671916, 674267, 63269, '<td valign="top">Lovely! I really love the angle which you shot this at, as well as the motion blur. The sepia works very well, too. Normally you would see a field of flowers like this in color, so this is an interesting and unique change. At first I didn''t really like how the highlights were blown out... but the more I look at it, the more I think it actually helps create a light, airy, spring-like atmosphere. Very beautiful!</td>', 'Lovely! I really love the angle which you shot this at, as well as the motion blur. The sepia works very well, too. Normally you would see a field of flowers like this in color, so this is an interesting and unique change. At first I didn''t really like how the highlights were blown out... but the more I look at it, the more I think it actually helps create a light, airy, spring-like atmosphere. Very beautiful!', '2008-05-01 15:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4671918, 674383, 53416, '<td valign="top">Sharp, good lighting, good use of negative space and has a very complimentary back ground.  Very good - well done!</td>', 'Sharp, good lighting, good use of negative space and has a very complimentary back ground.  Very good - well done!', '2008-05-01 15:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4671920, 674306, 53416, '<td valign="top">Very unique and an interesting perspective - but lacks lasting interest for me.</td>', 'Very unique and an interesting perspective - but lacks lasting interest for me.', '2008-05-01 15:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4671922, 674538, 53416, '<td valign="top">I love the highlights in her eyes.  Nicely composed too.</td>', 'I love the highlights in her eyes.  Nicely composed too.', '2008-05-01 15:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4671923, 672388, 63269, '<td valign="top">Something about the quality or focus here seems a little soft. Perhaps that was on purpose, but I''m not sure because the stuffed animal seems to be in sharper focus than the boy. In any case, this is very cute, although a different, more interesting composition might help give the photo more impact.</td>', 'Something about the quality or focus here seems a little soft. Perhaps that was on purpose, but I''m not sure because the stuffed animal seems to be in sharper focus than the boy. In any case, this is very cute, although a different, more interesting composition might help give the photo more impact.', '2008-05-01 15:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4671925, 673797, 53416, '<td valign="top">Nice old-time feel to this sepia photograph.Nicely composed too - the triangle formed by her elbow/arm and her line of sight really pulls your attention to the sewing machine.  Nice.</td>', 'Nice old-time feel to this sepia photograph.Nicely composed too - the triangle formed by her elbow/arm and her line of sight really pulls your attention to the sewing machine.  Nice.', '2008-05-01 15:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4671926, 674262, 63269, '<td valign="top">This is fascinating. The clouds in the sky almost look a bit like the tree tops in summer. A minor nitpick is the edge of the roof in the top left-hand corner. It''s a little distarcting, and I would suggest croping it out.</td>', 'This is fascinating. The clouds in the sky almost look a bit like the tree tops in summer. A minor nitpick is the edge of the roof in the top left-hand corner. It''s a little distarcting, and I would suggest croping it out.', '2008-05-01 15:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4671927, 674459, 53416, '<td valign="top">Great texture and contrast.  Makes me wonder why he''s sooo sad?</td>', 'Great texture and contrast.  Makes me wonder why he''s sooo sad?', '2008-05-01 15:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4671933, 673171, 53416, '<td valign="top">Sharp, nicely composed and interesting to look at.  Has an awkward glowing halo around it though.....</td>', 'Sharp, nicely composed and interesting to look at.  Has an awkward glowing halo around it though.....', '2008-05-01 15:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
