(4671937, 673587, 53416, '<td valign="top">Strong compostion and good contrast.  The sky works really well too.  Well done!</td>', 'Strong compostion and good contrast.  The sky works really well too.  Well done!', '2008-05-01 15:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
