(4671945, 674582, 53416, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and nice texture in the flowers.  Love the subdued tone as well.  Nice.</td>', 'Great lighting and nice texture in the flowers.  Love the subdued tone as well.  Nice.', '2008-05-01 15:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
