(4671971, 674138, 63269, '<td valign="top">I personally might suggest moving the camera down even further still, so that it is completely level with the horse''s head. The tones and soft focus here though, are very, very beautiful and give the image a lovely quality.</td>', 'I personally might suggest moving the camera down even further still, so that it is completely level with the horse''s head. The tones and soft focus here though, are very, very beautiful and give the image a lovely quality.', '2008-05-01 16:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
