(4673833, 674319, 49109, '<td valign="top">clever title, wouldn''t have noticed that</td>', 'clever title, wouldn''t have noticed that', '2008-05-02 06:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4673853, 674333, 73942, '<td valign="top">Great looking sky!</td>', 'Great looking sky!', '2008-05-02 07:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4673854, 673942, 73942, '<td valign="top">you made me laugh</td>', 'you made me laugh', '2008-05-02 07:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4673855, 673269, 73942, '<td valign="top">great shot, would work really well in the "tells a story" challenge, seems a little over sharpened though 6</td>', 'great shot, would work really well in the "tells a story" challenge, seems a little over sharpened though 6', '2008-05-02 07:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4673857, 674406, 73942, '<td valign="top">Great action shot just wish it was a little sharper. 6</td>', 'Great action shot just wish it was a little sharper. 6', '2008-05-02 07:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4673871, 673880, 73942, '<td valign="top">Love the title.</td>', 'Love the title.', '2008-05-02 07:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4673882, 672970, 78455, '<td valign="top">A familiar scene and view point, and not sure whether sepia works for this. However, nice tones and contrast and probably one of the better ones in this challenge.</td>', 'A familiar scene and view point, and not sure whether sepia works for this. However, nice tones and contrast and probably one of the better ones in this challenge.', '2008-05-02 07:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4673885, 673546, 73942, '<td valign="top">This seems a little too dark to fully appreciate all the detail that''s here.  This is well centered.</td>', 'This seems a little too dark to fully appreciate all the detail that''s here.  This is well centered.', '2008-05-02 07:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4673891, 674548, 73942, '<td valign="top">I love seeing that American Flag!</td>', 'I love seeing that American Flag!', '2008-05-02 07:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4673925, 674267, 39850, '<td valign="top">Nice feel to this image.  Nice scene.</td>', 'Nice feel to this image.  Nice scene.', '2008-05-02 08:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4673927, 674583, 39850, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and angle.  Looks a bit odd with his hand chopped and the ''something'' bottom right (horizon?) detracts a little.  Also seems to be an issue on his chin.</td>', 'Nice capture and angle.  Looks a bit odd with his hand chopped and the ''something'' bottom right (horizon?) detracts a little.  Also seems to be an issue on his chin.', '2008-05-02 08:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4673934, 674571, 39850, '<td valign="top">Like the patterns the toning has created, although perhaps bordering on extreme (contrast wise mainly).  Difficult, but maybe a more refined crop, especially to eliminate the bottom right, may have made this even stronger and given more compositional balance, but having said that, it does lend some more context/perspective..  Not sure on your title, unless it is intentional.</td>', 'Like the patterns the toning has created, although perhaps bordering on extreme (contrast wise mainly).  Difficult, but maybe a more refined crop, especially to eliminate the bottom right, may have made this even stronger and given more compositional balance, but having said that, it does lend some more context/perspective..  Not sure on your title, unless it is intentional.', '2008-05-02 08:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4673936, 673971, 39850, '<td valign="top">640 and a variation in composition / framing would have helped this.  Focal point/area is good.</td>', '640 and a variation in composition / framing would have helped this.  Focal point/area is good.', '2008-05-02 08:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4673943, 674499, 39850, '<td valign="top">Apologies in advance if wrong, but this looks like a mix of artificial and real plants/flowers.  The first thing I noticed was that there is no arrangement in the ''flora'' itself, the composition also needs work.  Overall it is too busy and, whilst I think I understand your concept with the textures, an image like this in a Sepia Challenge would have to be composed and arranged in a way to truly show the textures (if you want to keep this title), which you cannot do from this image, in my opinion.  The background fabric detracts from your subject as well.</td>', 'Apologies in advance if wrong, but this looks like a mix of artificial and real plants/flowers.  The first thing I noticed was that there is no arrangement in the ''flora'' itself, the composition also needs work.  Overall it is too busy and, whilst I think I understand your concept with the textures, an image like this in a Sepia Challenge would have to be composed and arranged in a way to truly show the textures (if you want to keep this title), which you cannot do from this image, in my opinion.  The background fabric detracts from your subject as well.', '2008-05-02 08:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4673954, 674233, 81664, '<td valign="top">This kind of looks more b&amp;w than sepia.</td>', 'This kind of looks more b&w than sepia.', '2008-05-02 08:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4673955, 674507, 81664, '<td valign="top">Your horizon is a bit crooked. But a cool photo!</td>', 'Your horizon is a bit crooked. But a cool photo!', '2008-05-02 08:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4673972, 673956, 81664, '<td valign="top">This still has a bit of color in the shot, on his face and top left area. I still love the photo though!<br/> <br/>EDIT: I am looking at this photo again on my Mac at home, and the color doesn''t  seem to be as apparent.</td>', 'This still has a bit of color in the shot, on his face and top left area. I still love the photo though! EDIT: I am looking at this photo again on my Mac at home, and the color doesn''t  seem to be as apparent.', '2008-05-02 08:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4673975, 673306, 39850, '<td valign="top">Good potential with this scene, looks like dogwood(?) - perhaps trying to steady the camera more (or less wind?) and also trying to separate the flowers from the background, maybe by zoom if you have no macro function - this seems out of focus as well, so trying to nail that will likely help produce a better quality image.  A more refined crop and attention paid to composition will also help.</td>', 'Good potential with this scene, looks like dogwood(?) - perhaps trying to steady the camera more (or less wind?) and also trying to separate the flowers from the background, maybe by zoom if you have no macro function - this seems out of focus as well, so trying to nail that will likely help produce a better quality image.  A more refined crop and attention paid to composition will also help.', '2008-05-02 08:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4673977, 672445, 81664, '<td valign="top">The sky looks a little blue/purple. Not sure if it''s just me. Doesn''t really look sepia. It is almost b&amp;w<br/> <br/>EDIT: I am taking a look at the shot on my Mac at home, and there is no blue/purple in the shot here at home.</td>', 'The sky looks a little blue/purple. Not sure if it''s just me. Doesn''t really look sepia. It is almost b&w EDIT: I am taking a look at the shot on my Mac at home, and there is no blue/purple in the shot here at home.', '2008-05-02 08:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674039, 672834, 39850, '<td valign="top">Nice concept but the oof fore dominates the image too much.</td>', 'Nice concept but the oof fore dominates the image too much.', '2008-05-02 09:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674054, 673165, 39850, '<td valign="top">Oo.  Nice.  Nice focus.  Just noticed the clock, given your title, shame that wasn''t more of a feature.  More refined crop top left to remove the frame may have given this a little more refinement, but fairly minor, plus I realize the clock would be sacrificed.  Tones work well here.</td>', 'Oo.  Nice.  Nice focus.  Just noticed the clock, given your title, shame that wasn''t more of a feature.  More refined crop top left to remove the frame may have given this a little more refinement, but fairly minor, plus I realize the clock would be sacrificed.  Tones work well here.', '2008-05-02 09:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674057, 674578, 39850, '<td valign="top">The reflections on the steps is a nice element in this image, especially with the toning.  Depending what you had to work with, perhaps a tighter crop at the top may have made this a stronger image, not sure.  Nice capture though, also of the little one trying to get up and the waves splashing.</td>', 'The reflections on the steps is a nice element in this image, especially with the toning.  Depending what you had to work with, perhaps a tighter crop at the top may have made this a stronger image, not sure.  Nice capture though, also of the little one trying to get up and the waves splashing.', '2008-05-02 09:15:29.000000', NULL, 1);
