(4674830, 673903, 53416, '<td valign="top">Makes me wonder why the shoes are there, and what happened to their owner?  The central composition really works well here, with great depth of field and good contrast.  I like this a lot.  Well done!</td>', 'Makes me wonder why the shoes are there, and what happened to their owner?  The central composition really works well here, with great depth of field and good contrast.  I like this a lot.  Well done!', '2008-05-02 13:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
