(4674837, 673262, 53416, '<td valign="top">Brilliant!  The central composition really works well.  The moody sky adds to the scariness of the ''prawn'',  Very sharp and with plenty of detail to study.  I love it!</td>', 'Brilliant!  The central composition really works well.  The moody sky adds to the scariness of the ''prawn'',  Very sharp and with plenty of detail to study.  I love it!', '2008-05-02 13:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
