(4674931, 674373, 92643, '<td valign="top">interesting lighting, especially on his left eye. i like the old, grainy feel to it, but personally i''m not sure that i like his head being tilted</td>', 'interesting lighting, especially on his left eye. i like the old, grainy feel to it, but personally i''m not sure that i like his head being tilted', '2008-05-02 14:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
