(4674986, 673439, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice subject for sepia. I like the light gradient.</td>', 'Nice subject for sepia. I like the light gradient.', '2008-05-02 15:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674987, 673315, 33672, '<td valign="top">Really nice scene for sepia. Could use a bit more contrast to really "pop" out.</td>', 'Really nice scene for sepia. Could use a bit more contrast to really "pop" out.', '2008-05-02 15:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675003, 674582, 33672, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo. Well composed with nice subtle tones. I think that a deeper DOF that includes both the model and the flowers would serve better (IMO). Perhaps you were trying to seperate the two. In that case I believe a bit more contrast would''ve helped achieve that.</td>', 'Interesting photo. Well composed with nice subtle tones. I think that a deeper DOF that includes both the model and the flowers would serve better (IMO). Perhaps you were trying to seperate the two. In that case I believe a bit more contrast would''ve helped achieve that.', '2008-05-02 15:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675010, 673920, 33672, '<td valign="top">Grain really adds to a perfect photo for sepia. Could use a bit more contrast.</td>', 'Grain really adds to a perfect photo for sepia. Could use a bit more contrast.', '2008-05-02 15:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675126, 673903, 67258, '<td valign="top">One of my favourite of the challenge - every element of this works together.  Bumping to 9.</td>', 'One of my favourite of the challenge - every element of this works together.  Bumping to 9.', '2008-05-02 16:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675130, 673329, 67258, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, wonderful lighting, and the headless composition is perect to show off the lighting and the form of the dancer.  The sepia toning is subtle, and just right for the image.  Superb, bumping to 9.</td>', 'Wonderful, wonderful lighting, and the headless composition is perect to show off the lighting and the form of the dancer.  The sepia toning is subtle, and just right for the image.  Superb, bumping to 9.', '2008-05-02 16:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675135, 673799, 67258, '<td valign="top">Beautifully observed -I love the play of light, and how the delicateness of the net curtains contrasts with the rather gruff exterior of the elderly gentleman, bumping to 10.</td>', 'Beautifully observed -I love the play of light, and how the delicateness of the net curtains contrasts with the rather gruff exterior of the elderly gentleman, bumping to 10.', '2008-05-02 16:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675138, 674342, 67258, '<td valign="top">Very artfully presented.  The sepia toning shows the textures to full advantage - a photo I have thoroughly enjoyed viewing.</td>', 'Very artfully presented.  The sepia toning shows the textures to full advantage - a photo I have thoroughly enjoyed viewing.', '2008-05-02 16:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675159, 673070, 5364, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice picture, but why so small?</td>', 'It''s a nice picture, but why so small?', '2008-05-02 16:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675194, 673709, 91197, '<td valign="top">Still smoking?</td>', 'Still smoking?', '2008-05-02 17:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675198, 674363, 91197, '<td valign="top">Let me guess... Kozani?</td>', 'Let me guess... Kozani?', '2008-05-02 17:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675204, 673070, 39850, '<td valign="top">The tones work well with this image.  640 would have helped you.  From what I can discern at this size, it looks like a boat in the background and water - which would make a nice scene (and bring your title to life more).  The cable/something on the floor behind the chair is a little distracting, perhaps trying a slightly different angle, including to get the arm of the chair at the fore in, may have made this an even better image.</td>', 'The tones work well with this image.  640 would have helped you.  From what I can discern at this size, it looks like a boat in the background and water - which would make a nice scene (and bring your title to life more).  The cable/something on the floor behind the chair is a little distracting, perhaps trying a slightly different angle, including to get the arm of the chair at the fore in, may have made this an even better image.', '2008-05-02 17:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675263, 674582, 39850, '<td valign="top">Difficult - because I can see her, I want her to be in focus (as well), but if this image is primarily about the ''Peach Bouquet'' (which it seems to be, unless I''m mistaken), then the flowers perhaps dominating the frame more, somehow, make this better in my opinion.  It''s a little hard to tell if this has had a sepia effect or just desaturated.</td>', 'Difficult - because I can see her, I want her to be in focus (as well), but if this image is primarily about the ''Peach Bouquet'' (which it seems to be, unless I''m mistaken), then the flowers perhaps dominating the frame more, somehow, make this better in my opinion.  It''s a little hard to tell if this has had a sepia effect or just desaturated.', '2008-05-02 17:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675269, 673145, 39850, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, sharper focus on at least the fore bloom make this better in my opinion, as would a little more light - especially because it/they have to compete with the strong lighting in the background.  The composition is nice, including the tones.</td>', 'Nice concept, sharper focus on at least the fore bloom make this better in my opinion, as would a little more light - especially because it/they have to compete with the strong lighting in the background.  The composition is nice, including the tones.', '2008-05-02 17:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675280, 674540, 39850, '<td valign="top">Interesting with the figures.  The shades came up well with the tones.  Nice clean quality image.</td>', 'Interesting with the figures.  The shades came up well with the tones.  Nice clean quality image.', '2008-05-02 17:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675299, 673242, 6534, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe I''m saying it, but its an adorable looking bug.  I think its a grasshopper.</td>', 'I can''t believe I''m saying it, but its an adorable looking bug.  I think its a grasshopper.', '2008-05-02 17:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675304, 674473, 6534, '<td valign="top">I love that he looks like a twig, or a branch from the tree.  I guess that''s what he''s going for :)</td>', 'I love that he looks like a twig, or a branch from the tree.  I guess that''s what he''s going for :)', '2008-05-02 17:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675308, 674545, 39850, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, certainly good potential with the sepia effect with the range of tones here.  Be good to have seen the hands in sharp focus, especially to discern their texture more - having said that, one of the fingerswith extra ''clay'' on it, looks a bit ''unappealing'' - minor things like that will enhance or detract from an image, in my opinion.  The crop and/or angle refined too.  Lastly, your title is somewhat confusing in English and seems to be a poor translation.</td>', 'Nice concept, certainly good potential with the sepia effect with the range of tones here.  Be good to have seen the hands in sharp focus, especially to discern their texture more - having said that, one of the fingerswith extra ''clay'' on it, looks a bit ''unappealing'' - minor things like that will enhance or detract from an image, in my opinion.  The crop and/or angle refined too.  Lastly, your title is somewhat confusing in English and seems to be a poor translation.', '2008-05-02 17:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675321, 674035, 39850, '<td valign="top">''Oops''.  This minus the vehicles - with just the woman and the scene, <i>plus</i> a sepia effect, make a good image.</td>', '''Oops''.  This minus the vehicles - with just the woman and the scene, plus a sepia effect, make a good image.', '2008-05-02 18:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675328, 674546, 39850, '<td valign="top">The composition seems off in this image and not sure the hue of the tone is enhancing it, especially in the sky.  Image looks tilted, but could be perspective.</td>', 'The composition seems off in this image and not sure the hue of the tone is enhancing it, especially in the sky.  Image looks tilted, but could be perspective.', '2008-05-02 18:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675335, 673912, 91716, '<td valign="top">Awww it''s the cutest thing ever - 10</td>', 'Awww it''s the cutest thing ever - 10', '2008-05-02 18:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675340, 674123, 39850, '<td valign="top">Nice little corner.  Tones brought out the details well.  Just noticed the flower(?) at the rear - or could just be the shape of the leaves.  The rock/something keeps distracting me bottom right, although it does add some good context - perhaps a little further out to include it more and have it in focus, not sure.</td>', 'Nice little corner.  Tones brought out the details well.  Just noticed the flower(?) at the rear - or could just be the shape of the leaves.  The rock/something keeps distracting me bottom right, although it does add some good context - perhaps a little further out to include it more and have it in focus, not sure.', '2008-05-02 18:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675355, 673416, 39850, '<td valign="top">That''s nice.  Nice clarity/focus.  Can''t help wondering about a variation in framing - squared perhaps, but your call.  The rose colored sepia is nice, but I also wonder about a more traditional hue - it may have brought out a few more elements and depth, maybe.</td>', 'That''s nice.  Nice clarity/focus.  Can''t help wondering about a variation in framing - squared perhaps, but your call.  The rose colored sepia is nice, but I also wonder about a more traditional hue - it may have brought out a few more elements and depth, maybe.', '2008-05-02 18:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675360, 674549, 39850, '<td valign="top">The focus seems sharper on the background than the bench.</td>', 'The focus seems sharper on the background than the bench.', '2008-05-02 18:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675370, 674057, 39850, '<td valign="top">If you really wanted to take a photograph of this trike, perhaps taking it outside and trying to recreate an old fashioned scene (which from your title is seemingly your intent), would have helped.  The indoors is too distracting and the focus seems sharpest on the indoors rather than the trike.  Although the partial corner of the sack bottom right adds a little interest.</td>', 'If you really wanted to take a photograph of this trike, perhaps taking it outside and trying to recreate an old fashioned scene (which from your title is seemingly your intent), would have helped.  The indoors is too distracting and the focus seems sharpest on the indoors rather than the trike.  Although the partial corner of the sack bottom right adds a little interest.', '2008-05-02 18:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675374, 674185, 39850, '<td valign="top">Like the concept but the framing and crop is not enhancing the tip of the bud/study of the rose.  A little more context (further out) likely have also helped, especially if you wanted to stick with this type of crop/framing.</td>', 'Like the concept but the framing and crop is not enhancing the tip of the bud/study of the rose.  A little more context (further out) likely have also helped, especially if you wanted to stick with this type of crop/framing.', '2008-05-02 18:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675387, 674473, 91716, '<td valign="top">Great photo, looks like a picture in an old book - 10</td>', 'Great photo, looks like a picture in an old book - 10', '2008-05-02 18:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675390, 674410, 39850, '<td valign="top">If you crop out the t-shirt, this becomes a very different style of image.  Her hairstyle lends itself to a feminine type of image and perhaps a rotate and crop (including tighter at the top to bring her more dominant in the frmae), may have given this something extra.  The light on her forehead is perhaps a little strong, but difficult in Basic.</td>', 'If you crop out the t-shirt, this becomes a very different style of image.  Her hairstyle lends itself to a feminine type of image and perhaps a rotate and crop (including tighter at the top to bring her more dominant in the frmae), may have given this something extra.  The light on her forehead is perhaps a little strong, but difficult in Basic.', '2008-05-02 18:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675392, 672786, 39850, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect with the leaves, but the bud needs to be in focus in my opinion - like the stone is bottom left.</td>', 'Interesting effect with the leaves, but the bud needs to be in focus in my opinion - like the stone is bottom left.', '2008-05-02 18:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675395, 673131, 39850, '<td valign="top">Nice concept - all the hands in focus and less fabric discernible at the rear make this much better in my opinion.  Difficult, especially if this is all you had/have to work with, but the ''little hand'' on the right detracts slightly from the overall ''effect'' and concept.</td>', 'Nice concept - all the hands in focus and less fabric discernible at the rear make this much better in my opinion.  Difficult, especially if this is all you had/have to work with, but the ''little hand'' on the right detracts slightly from the overall ''effect'' and concept.', '2008-05-02 18:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675423, 674172, 91716, '<td valign="top">Fell in love with it - 10</td>', 'Fell in love with it - 10', '2008-05-02 18:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675429, 673942, 39850, '<td valign="top">Yes I can.  Your eyes give you away.<br/> <br/>Perhaps zooming out just a <i>little</i>, to get ''your'' nose in sharper focus, may have given this a little more punch, that and either cropping/framing differently or even turning the camera on the side to get a ''long'' frame, might have given this a little extra as a photograph.  I like the background and creativity you have used.</td>', 'Yes I can.  Your eyes give you away. Perhaps zooming out just a little, to get ''your'' nose in sharper focus, may have given this a little more punch, that and either cropping/framing differently or even turning the camera on the side to get a ''long'' frame, might have given this a little extra as a photograph.  I like the background and creativity you have used.', '2008-05-02 18:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675441, 674319, 80912, '<td valign="top">This appears to be somewhat grainy - perhaps intentionally? But the composition is beautiful.</td>', 'This appears to be somewhat grainy - perhaps intentionally? But the composition is beautiful.', '2008-05-02 18:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675442, 672706, 39850, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Like your composition.  A more refined crop at the top make this even better in my opinion.  Like the focal areas, although would like to have seen all the pistils in focus too (but difficult).</td>', 'Nice.  Like your composition.  A more refined crop at the top make this even better in my opinion.  Like the focal areas, although would like to have seen all the pistils in focus too (but difficult).', '2008-05-02 18:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675443, 673449, 80912, '<td valign="top">And left out in the rain, too, it would seem. The shaodwos on the right and in the lower left are a bit distracting, but other than that, it''s a wonderful capture.</td>', 'And left out in the rain, too, it would seem. The shaodwos on the right and in the lower left are a bit distracting, but other than that, it''s a wonderful capture.', '2008-05-02 18:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675444, 672818, 39850, '<td valign="top">The tones have picked up the elements well in this.  Difficult, but perhaps a little lighter overall, just seems a little dark.  Apologies in advance if wrong, but this looks like it might need a nudge rotate up on the right to straighten.  Depending what you had to work with, perhaps a slight adjustment in the composition as well, mainly for overall balance.</td>', 'The tones have picked up the elements well in this.  Difficult, but perhaps a little lighter overall, just seems a little dark.  Apologies in advance if wrong, but this looks like it might need a nudge rotate up on the right to straighten.  Depending what you had to work with, perhaps a slight adjustment in the composition as well, mainly for overall balance.', '2008-05-02 18:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675447, 673799, 80912, '<td valign="top">The backlighting is lovely - even if the curtains are blown out a bit.</td>', 'The backlighting is lovely - even if the curtains are blown out a bit.', '2008-05-02 18:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675448, 673546, 80912, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell if the mood is supposed to be somber or festive.</td>', 'I can''t tell if the mood is supposed to be somber or festive.', '2008-05-02 18:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675451, 674036, 80912, '<td valign="top">That may be you reflected in the lower left, but it appears as if moneyis changing hands.</td>', 'That may be you reflected in the lower left, but it appears as if moneyis changing hands.', '2008-05-02 18:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675455, 674056, 80912, '<td valign="top">Not really an effective choice for sepia IMO.</td>', 'Not really an effective choice for sepia IMO.', '2008-05-02 18:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675457, 674543, 39850, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the two of them, the poses are nice and natural.  Can''t help but notice the legs chopped, especially because her hemline draws attention to that area of the image.  Perhaps a much tighter crop at the bottom and allowing the faces and arms/hands to dominate more, not sure.</td>', 'Nice capture of the two of them, the poses are nice and natural.  Can''t help but notice the legs chopped, especially because her hemline draws attention to that area of the image.  Perhaps a much tighter crop at the bottom and allowing the faces and arms/hands to dominate more, not sure.', '2008-05-02 18:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675459, 674031, 80912, '<td valign="top">Nice texture, great composition</td>', 'Nice texture, great composition', '2008-05-02 18:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675461, 673624, 80912, '<td valign="top">This almost looks like you were doing a sepia version of B&amp;W in color.</td>', 'This almost looks like you were doing a sepia version of B&W in color.', '2008-05-02 18:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675463, 672915, 80912, '<td valign="top">Great abstract. I hope you make a print of it.</td>', 'Great abstract. I hope you make a print of it.', '2008-05-02 18:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675464, 674285, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice.  Really like the diagonal line the flowers create in the image.  The tones are very nice, especially coupled with the nice bokeh at the rear.  Can''t help wonder about a fraction more ''depth'' somehow, perhaps a tweaking of lighting/contrast, not sure - although it looks like this image would be tricky to tweak without blowing the lighter areas, especially in basic.  This was comment #4000 for me - a nice image to do it on, thanks.</td>', '8 - Very nice.  Really like the diagonal line the flowers create in the image.  The tones are very nice, especially coupled with the nice bokeh at the rear.  Can''t help wonder about a fraction more ''depth'' somehow, perhaps a tweaking of lighting/contrast, not sure - although it looks like this image would be tricky to tweak without blowing the lighter areas, especially in basic.  This was comment #4000 for me - a nice image to do it on, thanks.', '2008-05-02 18:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675468, 674118, 80912, '<td valign="top">It''s a little too orange, and needs more contrast. The darkest tones aren''t dark enough and that gives is a foggy feeling.</td>', 'It''s a little too orange, and needs more contrast. The darkest tones aren''t dark enough and that gives is a foggy feeling.', '2008-05-02 18:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675470, 674396, 80912, '<td valign="top">You should have stood to the right a bit - so the line didn''t go right through the dog and one of the men. Otherwise this is very creative. I hope you get an Oobie.</td>', 'You should have stood to the right a bit - so the line didn''t go right through the dog and one of the men. Otherwise this is very creative. I hope you get an Oobie.', '2008-05-02 18:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675473, 673449, 39850, '<td valign="top">Depending what you had to work with, perhaps zooming out a little to allow more context may have given this a little more drama/depth/impact.  Not sure the framing enhances the image, but fairly minor.  I like that he is all wet (or has been wet) that and the interesting patterns &amp; work on the seat add a nice element to the image.  As for the concept and indeed the title, there are many of these at DPC - perhaps a Challenge with a bear ''left behind'' would be an interesting one.</td>', 'Depending what you had to work with, perhaps zooming out a little to allow more context may have given this a little more drama/depth/impact.  Not sure the framing enhances the image, but fairly minor.  I like that he is all wet (or has been wet) that and the interesting patterns & work on the seat add a nice element to the image.  As for the concept and indeed the title, there are many of these at DPC - perhaps a Challenge with a bear ''left behind'' would be an interesting one.', '2008-05-02 18:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4675474, 674011, 80912, '<td valign="top">I wish I could see more of his eye - what little of it I can see is mostly reflected glare. But other than that, it''s a really nice capture.</td>', 'I wish I could see more of his eye - what little of it I can see is mostly reflected glare. But other than that, it''s a really nice capture.', '2008-05-02 18:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
