(4677749, 673288, 91295, '<td valign="top">I like this image, but the houses in the background take away from the illusion of "Days Gone By".  A close crop would fix the one on the right, bu the ones on the left are problematic.</td>', 'I like this image, but the houses in the background take away from the illusion of "Days Gone By".  A close crop would fix the one on the right, bu the ones on the left are problematic.', '2008-05-03 17:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4677756, 673891, 91295, '<td valign="top">I like the concept of this image, but the out of focus (or soft focus) is distracting to me in a composition that I think would look better in focus.  Possible a DOF issue, as it seems that the focus point is in front of the camera lends by a couple of inches.  I think this would have been more effective if the front of the lens where the focus point.</td>', 'I like the concept of this image, but the out of focus (or soft focus) is distracting to me in a composition that I think would look better in focus.  Possible a DOF issue, as it seems that the focus point is in front of the camera lends by a couple of inches.  I think this would have been more effective if the front of the lens where the focus point.', '2008-05-03 17:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4677763, 674036, 91295, '<td valign="top">I like this image, but it would have been so much better for me if you could have found an angle that removed the pickukp truck from blending into the hood of the main subject.</td>', 'I like this image, but it would have been so much better for me if you could have found an angle that removed the pickukp truck from blending into the hood of the main subject.', '2008-05-03 17:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4677774, 674348, 91295, '<td valign="top">I like the main subject of this, but I think a tighter crop might have changed the feelings that one gets from this.  I see a bored audience not paying attention to the entertainer, but a tighter crop along the bottom and right side would truly highlight the entertainer, and make this a more enjoyable image (at least for me).  However, perhaps you intentionally left the audience, in which case "The Ignored Entertainer" might be more telling.</td>', 'I like the main subject of this, but I think a tighter crop might have changed the feelings that one gets from this.  I see a bored audience not paying attention to the entertainer, but a tighter crop along the bottom and right side would truly highlight the entertainer, and make this a more enjoyable image (at least for me).  However, perhaps you intentionally left the audience, in which case "The Ignored Entertainer" might be more telling.', '2008-05-03 17:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
