(4679618, 674258, 65037, '<td valign="top">beautiful.  <br/>perhaps if the camera angle were lowered such that her head was closer to the top of the frame, her eyes would be at 1/3 point and the vertical line of her arm would be longer and draw the viewers eye even more to her face?</td>', 'beautiful.  perhaps if the camera angle were lowered such that her head was closer to the top of the frame, her eyes would be at 1/3 point and the vertical line of her arm would be longer and draw the viewers eye even more to her face?', '2008-05-04 17:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
