(4683723, 674296, 39850, '<td valign="top">I''m not surprised.  Beautiful scene.  Wonder about the framing - maybe a whisker off each side and maybe, possibly more height if you had it, although not sure on that - but definitely seems a little off each side creates a bit more impact - although having said all that, this obviously holds personal meaning for you, so probably looks just as you want it.</td>', 'I''m not surprised.  Beautiful scene.  Wonder about the framing - maybe a whisker off each side and maybe, possibly more height if you had it, although not sure on that - but definitely seems a little off each side creates a bit more impact - although having said all that, this obviously holds personal meaning for you, so probably looks just as you want it.', '2008-05-06 07:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4683725, 674172, 39850, '<td valign="top">Bang, you got me.  Beautiful image and the beak came up so well with the tones.  Fairly minor, but a more refined crop to eliminate the ''strays'' make this even better, in my opinion.  Nice clarity on the head.  8</td>', 'Bang, you got me.  Beautiful image and the beak came up so well with the tones.  Fairly minor, but a more refined crop to eliminate the ''strays'' make this even better, in my opinion.  Nice clarity on the head.  8', '2008-05-06 07:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4683728, 673256, 39850, '<td valign="top">I nearly missed the tree hugger - saw your title and wondered what the fun was - the passer by? - the station? - ohh, there.  Perhaps a variation in cropping to bring the subject (based on your title) into play more, however the color of the clothing on the ''little one'' (compared to the tree) isn''t allowing much contrast with this tone - but maybe with a tighter crop, who knows.</td>', 'I nearly missed the tree hugger - saw your title and wondered what the fun was - the passer by? - the station? - ohh, there.  Perhaps a variation in cropping to bring the subject (based on your title) into play more, however the color of the clothing on the ''little one'' (compared to the tree) isn''t allowing much contrast with this tone - but maybe with a tighter crop, who knows.', '2008-05-06 07:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
