(4683763, 673622, 39850, '<td valign="top">Snap.  Her hat appears to be on back-to-front.  The pose of the fingers looks a little strange, unless she is playing with her hair.  I wonder whether a variation in cropping may have given this more of an edge.  Perhaps also slightly stronger / more dramatic tones - just my opinion on the image.  Might look exactly as you wished it.  Quite nice with just the eyelashes under the brim of the hat.</td>', 'Snap.  Her hat appears to be on back-to-front.  The pose of the fingers looks a little strange, unless she is playing with her hair.  I wonder whether a variation in cropping may have given this more of an edge.  Perhaps also slightly stronger / more dramatic tones - just my opinion on the image.  Might look exactly as you wished it.  Quite nice with just the eyelashes under the brim of the hat.', '2008-05-06 08:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4683775, 673015, 39850, '<td valign="top">Like the warm tone, although in retrospect wonder whether it makes the sky dominate a fraction too much overall, but fairly minor.  A more refined crop at the bottom make this even better in my opinion.  Like the ''people element''.</td>', 'Like the warm tone, although in retrospect wonder whether it makes the sky dominate a fraction too much overall, but fairly minor.  A more refined crop at the bottom make this even better in my opinion.  Like the ''people element''.', '2008-05-06 08:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
