(4686326, 674569, 39850, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by yanko:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Melethia:</b></div><hr/><i> Stray arms?  I thought the picture was very well framed and the arms were an integral part of the shot.  Shows what I know.  :-) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yeah I thought in Hindu the more arms the merrier. :P </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I did indeed consider the befitting connection with a <a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hindu_goddess" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Hindu Goddess</a> such as Mahadevi, Durga, Saraswati, Sri Lakshmi, Parvati, Kali, Mahavidya and Navadurga or even Sita, Radha, Matrikas and Shakti Peeths.<br/> <br/>Alas I didn''t have time to look up their names during voting.<br/> <br/>I <i>was</i> however going to ''suggest'' that it would have made a good and (maybe) unique image with <i>more</i> of the arms included.  The nice smiling face, nice warm tones, coupled with the range of ''dots'' (nice ones), created a nice image.  ''Nice''.</td>', 'Originally posted by yanko: Originally posted by Melethia: Stray arms?  I thought the picture was very well framed and the arms were an integral part of the shot.  Shows what I know.  :-)   Yeah I thought in Hindu the more arms the merrier. :P   I did indeed consider the befitting connection with a Hindu Goddess such as Mahadevi, Durga, Saraswati, Sri Lakshmi, Parvati, Kali, Mahavidya and Navadurga or even Sita, Radha, Matrikas and Shakti Peeths. Alas I didn''t have time to look up their names during voting. I was however going to ''suggest'' that it would have made a good and (maybe) unique image with more of the arms included.  The nice smiling face, nice warm tones, coupled with the range of ''dots'' (nice ones), created a nice image.  ''Nice''.', '2008-05-07 06:47:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4686333, 674353, 39850, '<td valign="top">Well I''m a little stumped - bit like this house should be.  Very good image, but.. maybe I need a lesson in <a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sepia_tone" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Sepia</a>.  If so, I apologize.  If not, I stand by my lonely little score.</td>', 'Well I''m a little stumped - bit like this house should be.  Very good image, but.. maybe I need a lesson in Sepia.  If so, I apologize.  If not, I stand by my lonely little score.', '2008-05-07 06:55:39.000000', NULL, 0),
