(4686865, 674218, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but the image seems a little muddy. I think the combination of the shallow(ish) DOF and the yellow(ish) sepia gives it that effect. Something has really been lost in the bottom portion of the image. No matter which way I position my monitor there are sections of flat blacks and flat grays</td>', 'Nice composition, but the image seems a little muddy. I think the combination of the shallow(ish) DOF and the yellow(ish) sepia gives it that effect. Something has really been lost in the bottom portion of the image. No matter which way I position my monitor there are sections of flat blacks and flat grays', '2008-05-07 11:23:10.000000', NULL, 0),
