(4687507, 673209, 85563, '<td valign="top">This is my favourite.... congrats on the soon to be 2nd place.  I didn''t actually vote... (soooo many photos to vote on... ugh) or maybe I could''ve helped this photo be 1st!  Love the contrast, the detail.  The hands almost seem like they''re reaching out of the photograph!  The hands seem a little centered in the photograph.  I probably would have cropped out a bit at the bottom (which would probably make it a square photo) or changed the composition when shootings to put the hands reach the bottom of the frame.  All in all... still my favourite and congrats on the ribbon.</td>', 'This is my favourite.... congrats on the soon to be 2nd place.  I didn''t actually vote... (soooo many photos to vote on... ugh) or maybe I could''ve helped this photo be 1st!  Love the contrast, the detail.  The hands almost seem like they''re reaching out of the photograph!  The hands seem a little centered in the photograph.  I probably would have cropped out a bit at the bottom (which would probably make it a square photo) or changed the composition when shootings to put the hands reach the bottom of the frame.  All in all... still my favourite and congrats on the ribbon.', '2008-05-07 15:41:39.000000', NULL, 0),
