(4688103, 673543, 70661, '<td valign="top">Great tones and textures. This works very well in sepia!</td>', 'Great tones and textures. This works very well in sepia!', '2008-05-07 19:23:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4688134, 673121, 85097, '<td valign="top">it is a beautiful photo! congrats on your almost blue.  I didnt notice a vignette in it either... I just assumed it was the lighting.  Great job.</td>', 'it is a beautiful photo! congrats on your almost blue.  I didnt notice a vignette in it either... I just assumed it was the lighting.  Great job.', '2008-05-07 19:36:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4688137, 673171, 85097, '<td valign="top">Benjamin this is a gorgeous photo!!  I am pretty sure I have seen it in real life... :)  Sorry about your DQ!  Did you stretch it??</td>', 'Benjamin this is a gorgeous photo!!  I am pretty sure I have seen it in real life... :)  Sorry about your DQ!  Did you stretch it??', '2008-05-07 19:38:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4688140, 673121, 70896, '<td valign="top">I was wondering were you had been! I''m sorry about the DQ, but it is a great shot! I hope to see more! :)</td>', 'I was wondering were you had been! I''m sorry about the DQ, but it is a great shot! I hope to see more! :)', '2008-05-07 19:39:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4688151, 674017, 92085, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the the top 10 finish Jaime!  That''s great.  You really do a nice job with your sepia and b&amp;w pics.</td>', 'Congrats on the the top 10 finish Jaime!  That''s great.  You really do a nice job with your sepia and b&w pics.', '2008-05-07 19:44:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4688170, 673799, 6999, '<td valign="top">Oh but its the newspaper - the sport section; how could this be more affecting than this slightly wrecked old gentleman still pursuing his dreams through the sports reports? And people worry about the exposure on the curtains?</td>', 'Oh but its the newspaper - the sport section; how could this be more affecting than this slightly wrecked old gentleman still pursuing his dreams through the sports reports? And people worry about the exposure on the curtains?', '2008-05-07 19:58:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4688177, 673121, 53964, '<td valign="top">Paulo, this photo is worthy of a blue, but you''re worthy of a gold for your honesty and humility :)</td>', 'Paulo, this photo is worthy of a blue, but you''re worthy of a gold for your honesty and humility :)', '2008-05-07 20:01:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4688198, 674584, 78196, '<td valign="top">Quite frankly I''m a bit staggered this didn''t score significantly higher. It''s clearly shot with an overall sepia tone so I fail to understand why you''ve been voted down. Some people are just really rigid with the challenge I guess, but it''s a beautifully taken, fun shot that you should be proud of.</td>', 'Quite frankly I''m a bit staggered this didn''t score significantly higher. It''s clearly shot with an overall sepia tone so I fail to understand why you''ve been voted down. Some people are just really rigid with the challenge I guess, but it''s a beautifully taken, fun shot that you should be proud of.', '2008-05-07 20:27:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4688207, 672970, 60862, '<td valign="top">Yes, it''s been done a few times before on DPC, but it''s your first time.  And you had to process it, which you did well.<br/> <br/>Congrats on what''s now the blue as your first ribbon and your new personal best!</td>', 'Yes, it''s been done a few times before on DPC, but it''s your first time.  And you had to process it, which you did well. Congrats on what''s now the blue as your first ribbon and your new personal best!', '2008-05-07 20:37:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4688209, 673687, 60862, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your first ribbon and new personal best!</td>', 'Congrats on your first ribbon and new personal best!', '2008-05-07 20:37:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4688210, 673992, 28742, '<td valign="top">Well, on the bright side, you got a fantastic portrait out of the deal. :)</td>', 'Well, on the bright side, you got a fantastic portrait out of the deal. :)', '2008-05-07 20:38:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4688214, 674454, 89515, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the great comments!</td>', 'Thank you all for the great comments!', '2008-05-07 20:40:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4688215, 673121, 60862, '<td valign="top">Congrats anyway on a great photo.  But congrats, too, on your integrity.</td>', 'Congrats anyway on a great photo.  But congrats, too, on your integrity.', '2008-05-07 20:40:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4688274, 673121, 36371, '<td valign="top">I agree with BeeCee:<br/>Your honesty will be your claim to fame!<br/>Hard one to take, but still a very nice image.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I agree with BeeCee:Your honesty will be your claim to fame!Hard one to take, but still a very nice image. ', '2008-05-07 21:27:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4688275, 673121, 54645, '<td valign="top">This image is superb. Well done. Go tell Adobe they owe you a blue ribbon.</td>', 'This image is superb. Well done. Go tell Adobe they owe you a blue ribbon.', '2008-05-07 21:27:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4688451, 673121, 52336, '<td valign="top">I say, enter a similar shot in a future challenge. :P  Beautiful work.</td>', 'I say, enter a similar shot in a future challenge. :P  Beautiful work.', '2008-05-07 22:06:03.000000', NULL, 0),
