(4688821, 674305, 23484, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. I love the dark spookiness of it. My immediate thought was a corpse crawling out of the grave.  I actually like this one better than your outtake.  For some reason, the web just seems to detract from the spooky feel. Just my useless opinion.</td>', 'This is a great shot. I love the dark spookiness of it. My immediate thought was a corpse crawling out of the grave.  I actually like this one better than your outtake.  For some reason, the web just seems to detract from the spooky feel. Just my useless opinion.', '2008-05-07 23:20:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4688841, 673121, 3020, '<td valign="top">I loved this shot and still love it and it is actually one of my favorite shots. Good of you to be honest, I''m sure others aren''t so forthcoming. Next time your blue will be for real.</td>', 'I loved this shot and still love it and it is actually one of my favorite shots. Good of you to be honest, I''m sure others aren''t so forthcoming. Next time your blue will be for real.', '2008-05-07 23:24:05.000000', NULL, 0),
