(4691749, 673687, 31948, '<td valign="top">Wow, I didn''t expect a ribbon! Thanks everyone for your votes and comments. The old woman is my mothers grandma (my grandpas mother). Her mother (my grandpas grandma) died 20 years ago and she was 106 years old. I still have vivid memories from my grand- grand- grand-mother.</td>', 'Wow, I didn''t expect a ribbon! Thanks everyone for your votes and comments. The old woman is my mothers grandma (my grandpas mother). Her mother (my grandpas grandma) died 20 years ago and she was 106 years old. I still have vivid memories from my grand- grand- grand-mother.', '2008-05-09 02:54:43.000000', NULL, 0),
