(4726636, 673167, 45475, '<td valign="top">The only saving grace for me in this is the retro theatre. As others have pointed out, the lack of contrast was a mistake. You can make a photo look "noisy, old, and faded" without necessarily losing all contrast. Is "Old Photo, with motte" some sort of filter?</td>', 'The only saving grace for me in this is the retro theatre. As others have pointed out, the lack of contrast was a mistake. You can make a photo look "noisy, old, and faded" without necessarily losing all contrast. Is "Old Photo, with motte" some sort of filter?', '2008-05-27 01:05:54.000000', NULL, 0),
