(4852787, 674584, 19311, '<td valign="top">I can''t help but feel that this score is ridiculous, really a 5.4? This is a truly outstanding portrait, clear sepia tone, great tonal range, tack sharp focus right on the face and just enough blur in the image to keep the fun and energy going.  The more I look at it the more i like it.  Would have been a 9 or 10 from me.</td>', 'I can''t help but feel that this score is ridiculous, really a 5.4? This is a truly outstanding portrait, clear sepia tone, great tonal range, tack sharp focus right on the face and just enough blur in the image to keep the fun and energy going.  The more I look at it the more i like it.  Would have been a 9 or 10 from me.', '2008-07-31 02:57:09.000000', NULL, 0),
