(4897663, 672547, 28742, '<td valign="top">Hey Jon - I love this shot. I am guessing it didn''t do too well in good part because it''s a bit flat. Adjusting the Curves would be a simple and very effective way to make it pop a bit more:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=712135" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/25000-29999/28742/120/712135.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/25000-29999/28742/120/712135.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/25000-29999/28742/120/712135.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>(hope you don''t mind) - I just did Curves (ALT+I,A,V on the kybd), then clicked the "Auto" button and PS did the rest. Hope that is helpful to you.</td>', 'Hey Jon - I love this shot. I am guessing it didn''t do too well in good part because it''s a bit flat. Adjusting the Curves would be a simple and very effective way to make it pop a bit more:  (hope you don''t mind) - I just did Curves (ALT+I,A,V on the kybd), then clicked the "Auto" button and PS did the rest. Hope that is helpful to you.', '2008-08-19 16:59:33.000000', NULL, 0),
